@startuml 05-candidate-start-interview
title Sequence 05 - Candidate consent, start and polling
skinparam shadowing false
autonumber

actor Candidate
participant "Candidate page" as P
participant "HTTP delivery" as H
participant "Interview use case" as A
participant "Execution Lifecycle" as L
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

== Open (BR-CORE-043, 046) ==
Candidate -> P : open /candidate/interview/page
P -> H : GET /candidate/session
P -> H : GET /candidate/interview
H -> A : ReadInterview
A -> DB : read consent, execution (if any)
H --> P : notice notice-261102, consent null, actions [accept]
P -> P : tab controller id and start key kept in sessionStorage

== Consent (BR-CORE-040) ==
Candidate -> P : accept notice
P -> H : POST /candidate/consents {noticeVersion, accepted: true}
H -> A : AcceptConsent
A -> DB : insert (insert-only)
H --> P : 201 {id, noticeVersion, acceptedAt}  (200 on repeat)

== Start (BR-CORE-041, 042) ==
Candidate -> P : start
P -> H : POST /candidate/executions\nIdempotency-Key, X-Interview-Controller {consentId}
H -> A : Start
A -> A : session must cover the 15-minute hard deadline
alt session too short
  H --> P : refused (candidate must re-enter through a valid invitation)
else covered
  A -> DB : check stored consent for current notice
  A -> L : commit-or-find execution\n(fingerprint of key + consent)
  L -> DB : lock assignment, insert execution bound to the pinned revision
  alt first call
    H --> P : 201 execution {state CREATED}
  else same key and intent (lost response, reload)
    H --> P : 200 same execution
  else different intent
    H --> P : 409 conflict, original execution unchanged
  end
end

== Poll (BR-CORE-043, 047) ==
loop every 2 s while CREATED or RUNNING
  P -> H : GET /candidate/executions/{id}
  H -> A : ReadExecution
  H --> P : {state, version, hardDeadline, isCurrentController, controllerVersion}
end
P -> P : stop polling at COMPLETED, FAILED or CANCELLED
note over P : terminal screen shows the outcome only.\nNo report, transcript, salary or controller id.

note over P, H : refresh only reads. It never POSTs start.\nCIN_START_UNCERTAIN is retried with the same key and consent id.
@enduml
